    <string name="notif_text">To keep the noise playing with the screen locked, Android requires a persistent notification while sleepr plays.\n\nIt lets you stop playback right from the lock screen.\n\nsleepr sends no other notifications and has no internet access.\n\nWithout permission the sound still plays, only the stop button in the notification is missing.</string>
